WEBVTT

00:02.230 --> 00:05.730
I want time off. I wanna go on a trip!

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
I want a dip in the hot springs...!

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
<b>Pulse-pounding
Hot Springs Gacha!</b>

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
"Always be facing forward"

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Limited Time Only Event

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
5* Character Drop Rate Up!

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
One 3* or above
guaranteed

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Once Daily

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Pull 10

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Pull 1

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Gacha Details

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Member Details

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Pull 1 (Paid)

00:08.730 --> 00:12.610
Time off? We just got done with New Year's.

00:12.610 --> 00:16.000
New Year's is over by the time you finish 
visiting your family and doing other stuff!

00:16.000 --> 00:17.760
They should extend it!

00:17.760 --> 00:18.870
Simmer down.

00:18.870 --> 00:22.870
You and Katase-san would love to 
recuperate in a hot springs too, right?

00:23.590 --> 00:26.890
Under a pristine sky, 
surrounded by nature's beauty...

00:26.890 --> 00:29.850
Listening to the chirping of 
birds and babbling of rivers,

00:29.850 --> 00:32.880
relaxing as you soak in hot water...

00:32.880 --> 00:36.360
It sounds like paradise for office workers!

00:36.360 --> 00:39.060
<i>She's captured Senpai's heart!</i>

00:39.440 --> 00:42.770
It's not a physical thing. 
I need to warm up mentally.

00:42.770 --> 00:46.060
I get you... I really get you, Hayakawa-san!

00:46.630 --> 00:49.570
Maybe they'll have a cat on the premises...

00:49.570 --> 00:54.270
Relief from this jungle of concrete 
underneath nothing but blue lights...

00:54.270 --> 00:57.820
<i>No good! Senpai's all the way off 
in fantasy land!</i>

00:57.820 --> 01:00.120
Do you seriously wanna go 
at the end of the month?

01:00.120 --> 01:02.080
On a weekday, using paid vacation!

01:02.080 --> 01:04.460
That sounds really, really good!

01:04.460 --> 01:06.040
You wanna come, too, Shinozaki?

01:06.720 --> 01:08.780
It'd be kind of weird for me to tag along...

01:08.780 --> 01:11.960
Don't you wanna catch a glimpse of 
your senpai, fresh out of the bath?

01:13.190 --> 01:16.570
I just got out of the bath.

01:16.970 --> 01:19.670
I can't deny that, but...

01:19.670 --> 01:22.520
If I take time off, too, work might be...

01:22.520 --> 01:23.820
You should go.

01:24.230 --> 01:25.760
Manager!

01:25.760 --> 01:27.730
We're in a slow period at the moment anyway.

01:27.730 --> 01:30.810
And paid vacation is 
meant to be used, after all.

01:30.810 --> 01:32.860
Thank you so much!

01:33.240 --> 01:36.030
In that case, why don't you come, too?

01:36.570 --> 01:37.660
Me?

01:37.660 --> 01:39.660
It'd be a little awkward being the only guy...

01:40.040 --> 01:42.960
That sounds nice! Let's all go together!

01:42.960 --> 01:45.480
I bet it'd be more fun with the whole gang.

01:45.480 --> 01:47.080
Right, Hayakawa-san?

01:47.080 --> 01:49.670
Well, I guess.

01:50.390 --> 01:53.420
All of us, on a trip to the hot springs...

01:53.840 --> 01:54.990
Senpai...

01:54.990 --> 01:56.390
Shinozaki-san...

01:55.250 --> 01:56.580
Mm-hm, mm-hm.

01:57.080 --> 01:58.330
Hayakawa...

01:58.330 --> 02:00.140
Sh-Shinozaki...

01:58.480 --> 02:00.110
Mm-hm, mm-hm.

02:00.640 --> 02:02.030
Hayakawa-san!

02:02.030 --> 02:03.430
Katase-san!

02:02.440 --> 02:03.980
Mm-hm, mm-hm!

02:04.920 --> 02:06.480
Mm-hm, mm-hm!

02:06.480 --> 02:08.970
This is gonna be awesome!

02:08.970 --> 02:09.880
Hold it!

02:09.880 --> 02:12.390
Can't you be normal about this?!

02:13.410 --> 02:20.090
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

02:24.950 --> 02:29.710
My Tiny Senpai

02:30.460 --> 02:32.790
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

02:33.210 --> 02:35.570
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

02:35.960 --> 02:41.800
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

02:41.800 --> 02:44.050
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

02:44.560 --> 02:47.100
<i>I want to touch her</i>

02:47.100 --> 02:52.590
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

02:53.110 --> 02:55.820
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

02:55.820 --> 02:58.570
<i>You're right next to me</i>

02:58.570 --> 03:04.820
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

03:05.580 --> 03:06.400
<i>HONEY</i>

03:06.400 --> 03:11.110
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

03:11.110 --> 03:14.320
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

03:14.320 --> 03:16.820
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

03:16.820 --> 03:17.650
<i>HONEY</i>

03:17.650 --> 03:22.430
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

03:22.640 --> 03:25.430
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

03:25.430 --> 03:31.860
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

03:42.990 --> 03:46.950
#08 Isn't It Time for Good Boys to Go to Sleep?

03:47.240 --> 03:50.000
What a nice, charming inn!

03:50.000 --> 03:54.000
And we'd normally be 
working at a time like this!

03:54.000 --> 03:56.430
Thank you, paid time off!

03:56.430 --> 03:58.520
I'll go get us checked in.

03:58.520 --> 04:00.510
Oh, thanks.

04:00.830 --> 04:04.970
I appreciate you handling 
the reservations and the drive, Manager.

04:04.970 --> 04:08.010
No sweat. I enjoy that kind of thing.

04:08.010 --> 04:10.860
Besides, Katase-san 
and I shared driving duties.

04:10.860 --> 04:13.660
I was kind of surprised 
to find out she can drive.

04:14.360 --> 04:16.740
Maybe I should get my license this year...

04:17.330 --> 04:18.270
Sounds good.

04:18.270 --> 04:21.930
That way, she can 
ride shotgun with you next time!

04:21.930 --> 04:24.460
I-I wasn't trying to—

04:25.280 --> 04:27.130
That was Senpai's voice!

04:25.320 --> 04:29.290
The Criminal And
the Hot Springs

04:25.320 --> 04:29.290
<b>Murder Hidden in
the Hot Springs Steam</b>

04:25.320 --> 04:29.290
<b>Mystery of the Hot Springs</b>

04:27.130 --> 04:29.290
D-Did something happen?!

04:30.540 --> 04:32.290
Are you okay, Senpai?!

04:36.290 --> 04:39.680
I'm in fluffy wuffy kitty witty paradise...

04:39.680 --> 04:41.800
<i>It was a scream of joy.</i>

04:41.800 --> 04:44.600
They say you can tell if an inn 
is good when it has cats, so...

04:44.600 --> 04:46.050
Nice one, Manager!

04:46.400 --> 04:48.300
Come right this way!

04:48.300 --> 04:50.760
Welcome!

04:54.470 --> 04:56.560
<i>What a complete lack of popularity!</i>

04:56.560 --> 04:59.630
Maybe they're too similar to like her?

04:59.630 --> 05:01.360
<i>So Senpai's a cat?!</i>

05:01.880 --> 05:07.110
<i>Come to think if it, I don't think I've 
ever seen her successfully pet a cat...</i>

05:07.650 --> 05:09.240
What do you think, Hayakawa?

05:09.240 --> 05:11.240
You talking to meow, Shinozaki?

05:11.240 --> 05:12.640
A living cat tower?!

05:12.640 --> 05:15.870
Is her body made out of catnip or something?!

05:19.440 --> 05:22.720
I heard this place had a hot springs pool...

05:22.720 --> 05:24.380
But this is pretty huge!

05:24.380 --> 05:27.230
Pretty nice, right? 
A pool for the middle of winter!

05:27.230 --> 05:28.800
Let's swim plenty!

05:29.160 --> 05:33.320
<i>I never imagined getting to see Senpai 
in a swimsuit in the middle of winter.</i>

05:33.320 --> 05:35.060
<i>Thank you, Manager!</i>

05:36.880 --> 05:41.070
<i>Senpai's swimsuit... Will it be cute?</i>

05:43.200 --> 05:45.290
<i>Or maybe classy?</i>

05:47.070 --> 05:48.650
<i>Or maybe...</i>

05:49.670 --> 05:51.450
Right over here, Katase-san!

05:51.840 --> 05:53.950
Sorry about the wait.

06:01.440 --> 06:03.940
<i>She went with a mature style?!</i>

06:04.420 --> 06:07.420
<i>No good! At the end of the day, 
she's my senpai from work!</i>

06:07.690 --> 06:10.330
<i>Gotta stay calm! Restrain those dirty thoughts!</i>

06:10.330 --> 06:13.430
<i>Go with a casual compliment...</i>

06:13.430 --> 06:15.430
You both look wonderful.

06:15.430 --> 06:17.400
Thank you.

06:17.400 --> 06:18.440
Thanks...

06:18.440 --> 06:19.690
<i>Manager!</i>

06:19.690 --> 06:21.940
<i>That was flawless, and he made it look easy!</i>

06:22.870 --> 06:25.690
<i>What do I even say?!</i>

06:26.500 --> 06:28.460
You really does look nice...

06:27.950 --> 06:29.610
<b>Chickening out with a safe approach</b>

06:32.870 --> 06:35.880
Th-Thank you...

06:36.370 --> 06:37.870
<i>She covered up?!</i>

06:37.870 --> 06:40.620
<i>I-I suddenly feel really self-conscious!</i>

06:41.080 --> 06:45.880
<i>I can't believe we're at the pool and I 
don't get to see Senpai in a bathing suit...</i>

06:46.400 --> 06:48.870
<i>Maybe I should just ask her to show it to me?</i>

06:49.350 --> 06:51.890
<i>No, that'd be sexual harassment.</i>

06:55.480 --> 06:58.360
Come to think of it, 
what's with the inner tube?

06:58.360 --> 07:00.410
I bought it just now.

07:00.410 --> 07:01.480
You work fast.

07:02.920 --> 07:06.650
Okay, Manager, let's head 
to the river pool with that inner tube.

07:06.650 --> 07:08.000
Sounds good!

07:07.300 --> 07:08.810
The river pool...?

07:08.000 --> 07:08.810
Come on, then!

07:08.810 --> 07:09.530
Sure!

07:09.530 --> 07:13.630
<i>That's right! If we get in the pool, 
I'll naturally get to see the swimsuit!</i>

07:13.030 --> 07:15.200
<b>IQ reduced to 3 by impure thoughts</b>

07:13.630 --> 07:15.200
<i>Good job, Hayakawa!</i>

07:15.200 --> 07:17.200
Senpai, come on!

07:17.200 --> 07:19.700
You all can go on and have fun.

07:21.520 --> 07:24.090
<i>She must really not want me to look at her...</i>

07:25.210 --> 07:27.590
<i>The problem is that I can't swim!</i>

07:27.590 --> 07:30.140
Th-Then maybe the wave pool...

07:30.140 --> 07:31.930
You all can go on ahead.

07:31.930 --> 07:33.260
The kiddie pool...?

07:33.260 --> 07:34.340
Go on.

07:41.850 --> 07:45.460
Senpai, can you not swim?

07:48.980 --> 07:52.540
It's not that I can't. 
It's just that I never have before!

07:52.540 --> 07:54.990
That would mean that you can't, wouldn't it?

07:59.720 --> 08:02.500
S-Sorry! I shouldn't make fun.

08:03.170 --> 08:05.050
I want ice cream!

08:05.050 --> 08:07.630
Let's go ask dad, then.

08:05.220 --> 08:09.480
When I was little... 
I went into the deep end of the pool,

08:09.480 --> 08:12.090
lost my footing, and almost drowned...

08:13.120 --> 08:15.480
I've had trouble with it ever since.

08:15.890 --> 08:19.390
Round and around and around—

08:16.320 --> 08:19.390
I do think that it looks like fun, but...

08:17.430 --> 08:19.390
Manager, slow down!

08:22.160 --> 08:24.860
In that case, do you want to go in together?

08:26.630 --> 08:29.150
I'm tall enough that I can stand on the bottom,

08:29.150 --> 08:31.210
and we can watch out for each other.

08:37.180 --> 08:39.220
I'll give it a try.

08:42.320 --> 08:45.120
This is warmer than I imagined.

08:45.450 --> 08:47.370
Are you scared?

08:47.370 --> 08:48.130
Not at all!

08:48.900 --> 08:52.130
I almost feel like I could 
start swimming already!

08:56.880 --> 08:59.030
What's wrong, Shinozaki-san?!

08:59.030 --> 08:59.980
Nothing.

08:59.980 --> 09:04.020
<i>She's trying so hard! 
Cast out those wicked thoughts, me!</i>

09:04.020 --> 09:05.050
Well...

09:05.880 --> 09:08.510
Could you teach me how to swim now?

09:08.510 --> 09:10.270
<i>Is this gonna work?</i>

09:11.090 --> 09:14.150
For starters, 
try putting your face into the water.

09:14.150 --> 09:18.760
Got it! Watch me! Here I go!

09:20.690 --> 09:22.910
<i>She might actually figure this out quickly—</i>

09:25.130 --> 09:26.420
<i>Or not!</i>

09:26.750 --> 09:31.470
I can normally put my face underwater 
with no problem... What's going on?

09:31.470 --> 09:34.050
You're probably nervous 
because of the location.

09:34.520 --> 09:36.930
Maybe if you imagine 
you're in the bath, it'll be easier.

09:36.930 --> 09:41.260
<i>The bath, the bath, the bath...</i>

09:43.330 --> 09:45.850
<i>She's acting like a cat that hates bathing!</i>

09:46.250 --> 09:48.810
Maybe submerging your face 
is a little too much to start with.

09:48.810 --> 09:50.250
Sorry...

09:50.250 --> 09:54.480
It's okay. Let's start with an inner tube 
and have you practice swimming.

09:54.480 --> 09:55.860
I'll go buy one.

09:59.680 --> 10:00.990
Shinozaki-san?

10:01.360 --> 10:03.740
<i>Not good! I've got a cramp.</i>

10:03.740 --> 10:06.600
<i>I got careless because the water's so shallow!</i>

10:06.600 --> 10:08.750
<i>Someone... help...</i>

10:14.370 --> 10:16.760
<i>S-Senpai?</i>

10:18.620 --> 10:19.680
Senpa—

10:19.680 --> 10:22.180
Live!

10:22.630 --> 10:25.180
I-I'm okay! I'm alive!

10:25.500 --> 10:26.620
How are you feeling?

10:26.620 --> 10:28.100
All good.

10:32.870 --> 10:34.440
Thank goodness...

10:39.140 --> 10:41.740
I thought you might die.

10:44.200 --> 10:47.200
No, it's okay! I'm feeling great!

10:47.200 --> 10:50.080
Don't worry! You can relax!

10:50.080 --> 10:51.280
Okay.

10:51.280 --> 10:52.900
More importantly, Senpai...

10:54.220 --> 10:55.960
You just swam.

10:58.470 --> 11:02.410
Oh, come on! That's not more important!

11:01.590 --> 11:02.970
S-Sorry...

11:03.620 --> 11:05.680
<i>Huh... dizzy...</i>

11:05.680 --> 11:07.470
<i>Had I not caught my breath yet?...</i>

11:08.600 --> 11:10.730
<i>I-I can't fall...</i>

11:20.200 --> 11:21.070
<i>Th...</i>

11:21.070 --> 11:23.820
<i>This is bad!</i>

11:24.280 --> 11:26.160
<i>Safe!</i>

11:34.170 --> 11:36.670
L-Let me retie that for you.

11:40.610 --> 11:41.930
Yeah...

11:43.570 --> 11:44.890
<i>There.</i>

11:44.890 --> 11:45.850
Sneak...

11:44.890 --> 11:46.930
<i>Nobody saw that, right?</i>

11:47.720 --> 11:48.780
Um...

11:49.180 --> 11:52.440
I'm so sorry! I don't know 
how to make it up to you!

11:53.320 --> 11:56.280
Is that all you have to say?

11:57.260 --> 12:00.190
D-Do you want me to bow?! 
Or maybe a written apology?!

12:01.240 --> 12:03.300
Never mind, then.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.000
Sulk...

12:05.000 --> 12:06.700
S-Senpai?!

12:17.890 --> 12:21.140
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>.

12:23.570 --> 12:26.440
I took a dip in the baths already.

12:30.970 --> 12:34.980
Oooh, that hits the spot...

12:36.610 --> 12:39.980
I can feel the exhaustion washing away.

12:40.500 --> 12:43.840
Christmas, the end of the year, 
and then New Year's...

12:43.840 --> 12:46.890
I think Japan might cram too many 
events into such small a window.

12:47.680 --> 12:48.990
Maybe.

12:49.520 --> 12:52.750
But I do feel really refreshed after today.

12:52.750 --> 12:56.460
Thank you for inviting me, Hayakawa-san.

12:56.460 --> 12:58.500
No, thanks for coming.

12:58.500 --> 13:00.350
If it was just me,

13:00.350 --> 13:04.820
I would've probably just whined about wanting 
to go and never actually done anything.

13:05.490 --> 13:10.010
And I definitely wouldn't have done 
anything as active as playing in the pool.

13:11.120 --> 13:18.020
I guess so. It's been a long time since 
I've worn a swimsuit, too. It was fun.

13:19.590 --> 13:21.530
It was fun, but...

13:22.070 --> 13:25.780
I feel like I've embarrassed myself a bit, too.

13:25.780 --> 13:29.820
I need to regain my honor 
as a senpai before bedtime!

13:31.710 --> 13:34.290
Shinozaki-san!

13:36.460 --> 13:38.160
Say "ahhh."

13:38.160 --> 13:40.540
Wh-Wh-Whoa, Senpai!

13:40.540 --> 13:43.990
Okay, who gave Senpai booze?!

13:40.540 --> 13:46.050
Come on, come on, "ahhh!"

13:44.500 --> 13:46.050
No one at all.

13:46.550 --> 13:48.090
No one stopped her, either, though.

13:48.090 --> 13:49.560
Maybe you should have?!

13:49.560 --> 13:52.180
Don't you remember 
what happened with the chocolates before?!

13:52.180 --> 13:53.310
Hayakawa-shan!

13:53.310 --> 13:54.560
Smooch!

13:54.890 --> 13:57.190
I am so, so grateful!

13:57.190 --> 14:01.340
I guess that was a thing! Must've forgot.

14:01.340 --> 14:03.050
I seriously doubt you forgot.

14:05.230 --> 14:07.150
Oh, man, my drink...

14:07.150 --> 14:08.910
Oh, dear!

14:08.910 --> 14:10.780
Let me wipe that up.

14:11.080 --> 14:13.910
I-It's okay! I can handle it!

14:13.910 --> 14:15.830
No...

14:15.830 --> 14:19.420
Today, until bed...

14:19.420 --> 14:22.340
Senpai is gonna take care of everything.

14:24.200 --> 14:26.840
No, it's s-s-seriously fine!

14:27.460 --> 14:29.770
Do you have an upset tummy?

14:29.770 --> 14:32.210
I can rub it for you.

14:32.210 --> 14:33.340
That's okay!

14:33.340 --> 14:37.000
Don't be shy now, come on...

14:37.000 --> 14:39.480
What's going on?! 
What kind of drunken behavior is this?!

14:39.480 --> 14:40.700
Does your tummy hurt?

14:40.700 --> 14:41.980
I'm telling you, it's fine!

14:40.870 --> 14:44.590
Does Katase-san get 
more intense when she's drunk?

14:41.980 --> 14:46.480
Please stop! You can't! This is... too much!

14:44.590 --> 14:46.030
Seems like it.

14:46.030 --> 14:47.570
Earlier, in the bath...

14:46.480 --> 14:47.570
I'm really fine!

14:47.570 --> 14:51.540
I need to regain my honor 
as a senpai before bedtime!

14:52.370 --> 14:54.810
After what she said...

14:54.810 --> 14:55.870
Maybe that's why.

14:55.870 --> 14:59.330
I don't see what she has to 
make up for in the first place.

14:55.870 --> 15:01.370
Turn this way!

14:59.330 --> 15:01.370
She probably just wants to show off a little,

15:01.860 --> 15:03.500
as your senpai.

15:05.910 --> 15:10.380
Okay, Shinozaki-san, let's wipe that mouth!

15:10.380 --> 15:12.960
<i>I have to admit, this situation...</i>

15:12.960 --> 15:15.720
<i>It's nice, but it's so awkward!</i>

15:16.640 --> 15:18.270
Hayakawa! Help!

15:18.270 --> 15:20.020
Sorry, Shinozaki.

15:20.440 --> 15:24.320
I'm feeling like another dip in 
the open air bath, since we're here.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.650
Oh, me, too.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.850
See ya!

15:28.850 --> 15:30.650
Traitors!

15:30.780 --> 15:34.860
Shinozaki-san, say "ahhh" again...

15:34.860 --> 15:37.160
<i>I'm alone with Senpai 
when she's acting like this?!</i>

15:37.160 --> 15:39.660
<i>In that case...</i>

15:40.660 --> 15:44.010
<i>I'll play along to the end 
so she can go to bed satisfied!</i>

15:44.680 --> 15:46.860
Tastes good?

15:46.860 --> 15:48.420
Tastes good...

15:49.170 --> 15:52.180
After dinner comes brushing teeth!

15:54.630 --> 15:56.580
I can't brush them like this.

15:57.800 --> 15:59.400
Right over here.

15:59.400 --> 16:01.430
O-O-On your lap?!

16:01.430 --> 16:04.320
Does it hurt anywhere?

16:04.320 --> 16:05.600
Nope.

16:05.600 --> 16:08.190
<i>Come forth, all of my restraint!</i>

16:08.190 --> 16:11.980
Once we're done, you'll go 
goosh goosh with your mouth.

16:11.980 --> 16:14.700
<i>That onomatopoeia sounds kind of dirty!</i>

16:14.860 --> 16:18.700
What a nice brushing! Clap clap clap!

16:19.160 --> 16:22.800
<i>As nice as this is... I can't take much more...</i>

16:22.800 --> 16:24.640
At this point, I just want to go to bed.

16:24.640 --> 16:26.880
Are you sweepy, Shinozaki-san?

16:26.880 --> 16:28.460
Uh, well...

16:28.860 --> 16:30.460
In that case...

16:30.930 --> 16:33.970
Senpai will put you to bed.

16:42.230 --> 16:43.980
I-I can't sleep yet!

16:43.980 --> 16:46.810
That's no good. No staying up late!

16:48.900 --> 16:52.490
Isn't it time for good boys to go to sleep?

16:52.490 --> 16:54.860
<i>There is no chance I'm sleeping!</i>

16:57.620 --> 17:00.280
Huh, that's weird.

17:00.280 --> 17:02.910
I was sure I brought it with me...

17:02.910 --> 17:04.120
She forgot something?!

17:04.690 --> 17:05.750
Oh, crap...

17:06.080 --> 17:09.750
<i>If they show up now, 
it's gonna be really annoying!</i>

17:09.750 --> 17:11.830
We'll celebrate with red bean breakfast!

17:12.710 --> 17:14.320
Hello, Onee-san?

17:14.320 --> 17:16.010
What?! They're getting married?

17:16.010 --> 17:18.260
<i>I need to avoid that at all costs!</i>

17:18.680 --> 17:20.120
Shinozaki?

17:20.120 --> 17:22.600
Weird, the lights are off.

17:24.720 --> 17:27.100
And they're both gone...

17:27.550 --> 17:29.370
I wonder if they went out.

17:29.370 --> 17:31.800
We didn't run into them in the halls, either.

17:31.800 --> 17:34.200
<i>I hid without thinking!</i>

17:34.200 --> 17:36.610
<i>But if she forgot something, 
they'll probably leave soon...</i>

17:36.610 --> 17:38.220
Find it?

17:38.220 --> 17:39.620
This is so weird...

17:40.210 --> 17:42.700
I thought I put it in here.

17:42.700 --> 17:47.120
The baths are separate anyway. 
You can go on without me, Manager.

17:47.120 --> 17:49.050
I'll wait. You can take your time.

17:49.050 --> 17:51.130
<i>You can't take your time!</i>

17:53.210 --> 17:54.460
<i>Crap...</i>

17:54.460 --> 17:55.980
Did you say something?

17:55.980 --> 17:57.070
Not me.

17:57.070 --> 17:58.990
I thought I heard a voice.

17:58.990 --> 18:00.220
Was it from outside?

18:00.220 --> 18:02.600
I think it was from in the closet...

18:02.600 --> 18:05.340
<i>Oh, no, no, no!</i>

18:12.940 --> 18:16.060
It's your special Senpai heating pad!

18:16.060 --> 18:17.450
S-Senpai?!

18:17.450 --> 18:19.740
Is it warm?

18:19.740 --> 18:21.570
Yes, incredibly...

18:21.570 --> 18:23.800
Wait, heating pad?!

18:23.800 --> 18:26.040
That's right. Sneezing and sweating...

18:26.040 --> 18:28.080
You definitely need warming up.

18:29.140 --> 18:31.580
It really is coming from in there...

18:32.320 --> 18:33.630
<i>Oh, no!</i>

18:34.090 --> 18:36.240
Senpai heating pad!

18:36.240 --> 18:40.570
W-W-Wait, now's not the time! Please, let go!

18:40.570 --> 18:43.350
It's an adhesive, and not going anywhere!

18:45.520 --> 18:47.320
Feeling warm?

18:45.520 --> 18:48.100
<i>Crap, crap, crap!</i>

18:50.100 --> 18:54.520
Senpai... please, quiet down for a sec.

18:56.870 --> 18:59.370
Maybe you're imagining it.

18:59.370 --> 19:00.610
I guess.

19:02.160 --> 19:04.430
<i>We're saved...</i>

19:04.430 --> 19:06.450
Shinozaki-san...

19:06.960 --> 19:07.980
Your hand...

19:08.860 --> 19:10.330
Your hand's on my chest.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.680
Did you hear that?

19:16.680 --> 19:17.770
Yeah...

19:18.510 --> 19:21.130
Come to think of it, 
a long time ago, this inn was where—

19:21.130 --> 19:22.390
Stop it right now!

19:23.480 --> 19:26.300
We were enjoying this trip together...

19:27.880 --> 19:32.250
Wait, is the reason 
they're missing because of ghosts?!

19:33.160 --> 19:34.900
We can't rule that out.

19:34.900 --> 19:38.040
Wh-Wh-What do we do?! 
Call the police?! An exorcist?!

19:38.040 --> 19:40.310
W-We need to find them, either way!

19:39.220 --> 19:40.870
Hayakawa-san, calm down!

19:42.340 --> 19:45.990
That voice... Hayakawa-shan?

19:46.120 --> 19:50.040
Hayakawa-shan! I'm right here!

19:50.350 --> 19:52.500
Senpai's going out!

19:52.500 --> 19:54.810
<i>What do I do, what do I do?!</i>

19:58.760 --> 20:00.760
Hayakawa... san...

20:03.440 --> 20:06.760
H-Huh? It's all dark...

20:06.760 --> 20:08.170
Help!

20:08.850 --> 20:12.160
Hayakawa-san! Wait up!

20:12.160 --> 20:14.790
We managed to avoid being found...

20:17.410 --> 20:18.580
<i>She's asleep.</i>

20:19.990 --> 20:23.660
<i>I guess that wraps this up... I hope.</i>

20:24.120 --> 20:26.360
Shinozaki-san...

20:26.360 --> 20:28.910
Are you okay?

20:30.970 --> 20:33.770
Senpai, you're gonna catch a cold like that.

20:33.770 --> 20:35.420
Let's get you in a futon.

20:35.420 --> 20:37.020
'Kay...

20:41.270 --> 20:43.680
<i>She was worried about 
how she came across before...</i>

20:44.960 --> 20:48.100
<i>But I'm glad I got to see 
a different side of you, Senpai.</i>

20:52.870 --> 20:53.810
<i>Her hands...</i>

20:58.010 --> 20:59.800
<i>She won't let go...</i>

20:59.800 --> 21:02.820
<i>Oh, this is really bad!</i>

21:04.020 --> 21:05.050
Right this way!

21:05.050 --> 21:06.820
There's a ghost in this room!

21:15.270 --> 21:18.250
Hello, Onee-san? 
Prepare some red beans and rice.

21:18.250 --> 21:19.710
<i>I see. A wedding it is.</i>

21:19.710 --> 21:21.320
Stop!

21:20.880 --> 21:23.390
Oh, what a glorious day!

21:21.320 --> 21:23.150
Uh, look, this is actually—

21:23.150 --> 21:25.390
Where's the ghost? Where'd it go?

21:23.390 --> 21:26.990
Senpai, could you wake up 
and help me explain? Please...

21:24.320 --> 21:26.170
I better look into venues...

21:25.370 --> 21:27.970
Wait, what was going on?

21:26.990 --> 21:29.900
Oh, I actually know someone 
who can help with that.

21:27.970 --> 21:30.260
And I'll be aiding 
with dress selection, of course.

21:29.900 --> 21:31.740
So much fun...

21:30.260 --> 21:32.970
You've got it all wrong!

21:46.300 --> 21:50.180
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

21:50.180 --> 21:55.080
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

21:55.640 --> 21:59.560
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

21:59.560 --> 22:03.780
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

22:05.000 --> 22:08.740
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

22:08.740 --> 22:13.630
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

22:14.290 --> 22:18.130
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

22:18.130 --> 22:22.300
<i>Almost like magic</i>

22:22.720 --> 22:27.380
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

22:27.380 --> 22:32.990
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

22:33.740 --> 22:37.780
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

22:37.780 --> 22:42.180
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

22:43.050 --> 22:47.100
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

22:47.100 --> 22:51.120
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

22:51.120 --> 22:53.410
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

23:00.520 --> 23:02.740
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>
